error[L0336]: `loop` takes a list of bindings
 --> expand/loop_binding_list_errors.rslisp:2:9
  |
2 |   (loop index 0 (recur (+ index 1))))
  |         ^^^^^ not a list of bindings
  |
  = help: write the bindings in a list, as `(loop (index 0) ...)`

error[L0335]: `loop` has no body
 --> expand/loop_binding_list_errors.rslisp:4:18
  |
4 | (defn no-body () (loop (index 0)))
  |                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ its bindings reach no form
