error[L0336]: each name and its value go straight into the binding list of `loop`, without their own parentheses
 --> expand/loop_binding_list_errors.rslisp:7:10
  |
7 |   (loop ((step 0) (total 1))
  |          ^^^^^^^^ a name and its value in their own parentheses
  |
  = help: write it as `(loop (step 0 total 1) ...)`

error[L0334]: a name in the binding list of `loop` has no value
  --> expand/loop_binding_list_errors.rslisp:13:10
   |
13 |   (loop ((count usize)) count))
   |          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this name has no value
   |
   = help: write its value after it, as `(loop ((count usize) value) ...)`, or write each name and its value without their own parentheses, as `(loop (count usize) ...)`

